<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>E-Visa Destinations | VisaMaster</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Explore countries offering E-Visa options with VisaMaster." />

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/global.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/navbar.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/footer.css" />

  <style>
    /* E-Visa page: deliberately independent from the All Visas directory */
    .ev-page {
      --ev-navy: #102b4e;
      --ev-blue: #1e4773;
      --ev-gold: #e8ad32;
      --ev-cream: #fffaf0;
      --ev-ink: #172b43;
      color: var(--ev-ink);
      background: #fff;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .ev-container { width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin: 0 auto; }
    .ev-hero {
      position: relative;
      isolation: isolate;
      padding: 76px 0 88px;
      color: #fff;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 82% 20%, rgba(232,173,50,.22), transparent 25%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 8% 100%, rgba(84,139,190,.22), transparent 32%),
        linear-gradient(118deg, #0c2340 0%, #163d66 58%, #214f79 100%);
    }
    .ev-hero::before, .ev-hero::after {
      content: ""; position: absolute; z-index: -1; border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.22);
      border-radius: 50%; transform: rotate(-22deg);
    }
    .ev-hero::before { width: 430px; height: 170px; right: -55px; top: 25px; }
    .ev-hero::after { width: 330px; height: 130px; right: 15px; top: 58px; }
    .ev-hero-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.25fr .75fr; gap: 50px; align-items: center; }
    .ev-eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #f4c65f; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .19em; text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .ev-eyebrow::before { content: ""; width: 28px; height: 2px; background: var(--ev-gold); }
    .ev-hero h1 { max-width: 700px; margin: 0; color: #fff; font-size: clamp(38px, 5.3vw, 66px); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
    .ev-hero h1 span { color: #f2c45b; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; }
    .ev-hero-copy { max-width: 610px; margin: 22px 0 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,.78); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.85; }
    .ev-hero-points { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 22px; margin-top: 28px; }
    .ev-hero-points span { color: #f8f3e9; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
    .ev-hero-points b { margin-right: 7px; color: #f2c45b; }
    .ev-passport {
      justify-self: end; position: relative; width: min(100%, 290px); min-height: 310px; padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3); border-radius: 18px 18px 42px 18px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #f6d779, #dba83c); color: #173657;
      box-shadow: 18px 22px 0 rgba(4,19,36,.18), 0 25px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
      transform: rotate(5deg);
    }
    .ev-passport::before { content: "✈"; position: absolute; right: 24px; top: 15px; color: rgba(16,43,78,.28); font-size: 40px; }
    .ev-passport-mark { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 78px; height: 78px; margin: 26px auto 20px; border: 2px solid rgba(16,43,78,.45); border-radius: 50%; font-size: 37px; }
    .ev-passport small { display: block; text-align: center; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .24em; }
    .ev-passport strong { display: block; margin-top: 9px; text-align: center; font-family: Georgia,serif; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: .08em; }
    .ev-passport-line { height: 1px; margin-top: 22px; background: rgba(16,43,78,.3); }
    .ev-search-area { position: relative; z-index: 2; margin-top: -35px; }
    .ev-search-panel {
      position: relative; gap: 16px; padding: 19px 22px;
      border: 1px solid #e7dfcf; border-radius: 18px;
      background: linear-gradient(110deg, #fff 0%, #fffdf8 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 42px rgba(9,31,55,.13);
    }
    .ev-search-symbol {
      flex-basis: 50px; width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 15px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #fff1c9, #f8df9e);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(184,130,28,.12);
      font-size: 25px;
    }
    .ev-search-content label {
      margin-bottom: 7px; color: #a27419; font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: .16em; font-weight: 900;
    }
    .ev-search-content input {
      min-height: 27px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .ev-search-content input::placeholder { color: #9aa4ae; font-weight: 400; }
    .ev-search-hint {
      flex: 0 0 auto; padding: 8px 11px; border: 1px solid #eee5d2;
      border-radius: 20px; background: #fffaf0; color: #98701f;
      font-size: 9px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .1em;
    }
    #vmClearCountrySearch {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 5px;
      width: auto; height: 34px; padding: 0 11px; border: 1px solid #e4e8ec;
      border-radius: 9px; background: #f5f7f9; color: #536579;
      cursor: pointer; font-size: 18px; transition: background .2s ease, border-color .2s ease;
    }
    #vmClearCountrySearch:hover { border-color: #d8bd7d; background: #fff6df; }
    #vmClearCountrySearch[hidden] { display: none !important; }
    .ev-clear-text { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; }
    .ev-search-panel {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; padding: 20px 24px;
      border: 1px solid #e9e4d9; border-radius: 16px; background: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 38px rgba(20,43,68,.10);
    }
    .ev-search-symbol { display: grid; flex: 0 0 44px; place-items: center; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 13px; background: #fff4d8; color: #a8730c; font-size: 22px; }
    .ev-search-content { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .ev-search-content label { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--ev-ink); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; }
    .ev-search-content input { width: 100%; padding: 5px 0; border: 0; outline: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--ev-ink); font: inherit; font-size: 14px; }
    .ev-search-content input::placeholder { color: #8995a3; }
    .ev-search-content input:focus { outline: none; }
    .ev-search-content:focus-within { outline: 2px solid rgba(232,173,50,.28); outline-offset: 7px; border-radius: 3px; }
    #vmClearCountrySearch { border: 0; background: #f1f4f7; border-radius: 50%; width: 30px; height: 30px; color: #52677d; cursor: pointer; font-size: 19px; }
    .ev-directory { padding: 72px 0 78px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, #fbfaf6 100%); }
    .ev-section-top { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 25px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .ev-section-kicker { color: #a7781d; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .ev-section-top h2 { margin: 9px 0 7px; color: var(--ev-navy); font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px); letter-spacing: -.035em; }
    .ev-section-top p { margin: 0; color: #738092; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .ev-count { flex: 0 0 auto; min-width: 100px; padding: 12px 17px; border: 1px solid #eadfca; border-radius: 13px; background: #fff; text-align: center; }
    .ev-count strong { display: block; color: var(--ev-navy); font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.1; }
    .ev-count span { color: #8490a0; font-size: 10px; }
    .ev-country-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
    .ev-country-card {
      position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 188px; padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #e8e6df; border-radius: 17px; background: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(16,43,78,.045); transition: transform .22s ease, box-shadow .22s ease, border-color .22s ease;
    }
    .ev-country-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); border-color: #e4bd66; box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(16,43,78,.11); }
    .ev-country-card[hidden], #vmCountryGrid[hidden] { display: none !important; }
    .ev-card-top { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 13px; }
    .ev-flag {
      display: grid; flex: 0 0 58px; place-items: center; width: 58px; height: 48px; overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid #e9e8e2; border-radius: 11px; background: #f7f5ef; color: #607080; font-size: 26px;
    }
    .ev-flag img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
    .ev-flag-fallback { font-size: 25px; }
    .ev-country-info { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
    .ev-country-info h3 { overflow: hidden; margin: 0 0 7px; color: var(--ev-navy); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
    .ev-available { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; color: #65806d; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; }
    .ev-available::before { content: ""; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #58a875; }
    .ev-card-index { position: absolute; top: 19px; right: 19px; color: #c3cbd2; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; }
    .ev-card-link {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-top: auto; padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 9px; background: var(--ev-navy); color: #fff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none;
      transition: background .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
    }
    .ev-card-link:hover { background: #214f79; transform: translateX(2px); }
    .ev-card-link span { color: #f2c45b; font-size: 17px; }
    .ev-message { padding: 30px; border: 1px dashed #d8cba9; border-radius: 15px; background: #fffdf7; color: #657184; text-align: center; }
    .ev-message strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 7px; color: var(--ev-navy); }
    .ev-no-results { padding: 38px 20px; border: 1px dashed #d8cba9; border-radius: 15px; background: #fffdf7; text-align: center; }
    .ev-no-results[hidden] { display: none !important; }
    .ev-no-results h3 { margin: 8px 0; color: var(--ev-navy); }
    .ev-no-results p { color: #788596; font-size: 13px; }
    .ev-contact-link { display: inline-flex; margin-top: 8px; padding: 11px 18px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--ev-navy); color: #fff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
    .ev-disclaimer { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin: 24px 0 0; padding: 15px 17px; border-left: 3px solid var(--ev-gold); border-radius: 0 9px 9px 0; background: #f5f3ed; color: #727d89; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .ev-disclaimer b { color: #a7781d; }
    .ev-steps { padding: 76px 0; background: #f1f4f6; }
    .ev-steps-heading { max-width: 650px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
    .ev-steps-heading h2 { margin: 10px 0; color: var(--ev-navy); font-size: clamp(27px, 3vw, 37px); letter-spacing: -.035em; }
    .ev-steps-heading p { color: #778393; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .ev-steps-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
    .ev-step { position: relative; padding: 25px; border: 1px solid #e1e6e9; border-radius: 14px; background: #fff; }
    .ev-step-no { color: #c08b24; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .12em; }
    .ev-step-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 43px; height: 43px; margin: 17px 0; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff3d5; color: #9b6b13; font-size: 20px; }
    .ev-step h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--ev-navy); font-size: 16px; }
    .ev-step p { margin: 0; color: #7a8795; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .ev-note { padding: 0 0 75px; background: #f1f4f6; }
    .ev-note-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; padding: 25px 28px; border-radius: 16px; background: #102b4e; color: #fff; }
    .ev-note-icon { display: grid; flex: 0 0 46px; place-items: center; width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; background: #f2c45b; color: #102b4e; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 900; }
    .ev-note-copy { flex: 1; }
    .ev-note-copy h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; color: #fff; font-size: 17px; }
    .ev-note-copy p { margin: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,.72); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .ev-note-link { flex: 0 0 auto; padding: 11px 16px; border-radius: 8px; background: #f2c45b; color: #102b4e; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; }
    @media (max-width: 850px) {
      .ev-hero { padding: 58px 0 75px; }
      .ev-hero-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr .55fr; gap: 22px; }
      .ev-passport { width: 220px; min-height: 260px; padding: 20px; }
      .ev-country-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .ev-container { width: min(100% - 30px, 480px); }
      .ev-hero { padding: 48px 0 68px; }
      .ev-hero-inner { display: block; }
      .ev-hero h1 { font-size: 42px; }
      .ev-hero-copy { font-size: 13px; }
      .ev-passport { display: none; }
      .ev-search-panel { gap: 10px; padding: 13px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .ev-search-symbol { flex-basis: 43px; width: 43px; height: 43px; }
      .ev-search-content { flex-basis: calc(100% - 60px); }
      .ev-search-hint { display: none; }
      #vmClearCountrySearch { margin-left: 53px; }
      .ev-search-area { margin-top: -27px; }
      .ev-directory { padding: 55px 0 58px; }
      .ev-section-top { align-items: start; }
      .ev-section-top h2 { font-size: 27px; }
      .ev-count { min-width: 72px; padding: 9px 10px; }
      .ev-count strong { font-size: 23px; }
      .ev-country-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
      .ev-country-card { min-height: 165px; padding: 16px; }
      .ev-steps { padding: 55px 0; }
      .ev-steps-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .ev-note { padding-bottom: 55px; }
      .ev-note-inner { align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 20px; }
      .ev-note-link { margin-left: 66px; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .ev-country-card, .ev-card-link { transition: none; }
    }
    
/* =====================================================
   E-VISA SEARCH SUGGESTION DROPDOWN
===================================================== */

/* Search panel positioning */
.ev-search-panel {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 100;
  overflow: visible;
}

/* Search content */
.ev-search-content {
  position: relative;
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}

/* Suggestions container */
#vmEVisaSuggestions {
  position: absolute;
  top: calc(100% + 22px);
  left: -5px;
  right: -5px;
  z-index: 9999;

  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4px;

  max-height: 340px;
  overflow-y: auto;

  padding: 8px;

  background: #ffffff;
  border: 1px solid #e8e1d3;
  border-radius: 14px;

  box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(16, 43, 78, 0.17);
}

/* Important: hidden state */
#vmEVisaSuggestions[hidden] {
  display: none !important;
}

/* Individual country suggestion */
#vmEVisaSuggestions .ev-suggestion-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  width: 100%;
  gap: 13px;

  padding: 12px 14px;

  border: none;
  border-radius: 10px;

  background: #ffffff;
  text-align: left;
  cursor: pointer;

  transition: background 0.2s ease;
}

/* Hover and keyboard selection */
#vmEVisaSuggestions .ev-suggestion-item:hover,
#vmEVisaSuggestions .ev-suggestion-item.active {
  background: #fff6df;
}

/* Country flag */
#vmEVisaSuggestions .ev-suggestion-flag {
  display: grid;
  flex: 0 0 45px;
  width: 45px;
  height: 35px;
  place-items: center;

  overflow: hidden;

  border: 1px solid #eee7d9;
  border-radius: 8px;

  background: #f7f5ef;
  font-size: 22px;
}

#vmEVisaSuggestions .ev-suggestion-flag img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
}

/* Country information */
#vmEVisaSuggestions .ev-suggestion-info {
  display: flex;
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 5px;
}

#vmEVisaSuggestions .ev-suggestion-info strong {
  color: #102b4e;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 800;
}

#vmEVisaSuggestions .ev-suggestion-info small {
  color: #8792a0;
  font-size: 11px;
}

/* Arrow */
#vmEVisaSuggestions .ev-suggestion-arrow {
  color: #b98524;
  font-size: 21px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

/* No results */
#vmEVisaSuggestions .ev-suggestion-empty {
  padding: 22px 12px;
  color: #788596;
  font-size: 13px;
  text-align: center;
}

/* Scrollbar */
#vmEVisaSuggestions::-webkit-scrollbar {
  width: 6px;
}

#vmEVisaSuggestions::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
  background: #d9c99f;
  border-radius: 10px;
}

/* Mobile */
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  #vmEVisaSuggestions {
    left: -5px;
    right: -5px;
    max-height: 280px;
  }

  #vmEVisaSuggestions .ev-suggestion-item {
    padding: 11px;
  }
}

  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <%- include("../partials/navbar", { currentPage: "e-visa" }) %>

  <%
    const eVisaCountries = Array.isArray(countries) ? countries : [];

    const flagPath = (flag) => {
      const value = String(flag || "").trim();
      if (value.startsWith("public/")) return value.replace(/^public/, "");
      if (value && !value.startsWith("/") && !/^https?:\/\//i.test(value)) return "/" + value;
      return value;
    };

    const isFlagImage = (flag) => {
      const value = String(flag || "").trim();
      return /^(https?:\/\/|\/|images\/|public\/)/i.test(value) &&
        /\.(png|jpe?g|svg|webp)(\?.*)?$/i.test(value);
    };
  %>

  <main class="ev-page">
    <section class="ev-hero">
      <div class="ev-container ev-hero-inner">
        <div>
          <span class="ev-eyebrow">VisaMaster / Digital travel desk</span>
          <h1>Travel lighter.<br />Go <span> E-Visa.</span></h1>
          <p class="ev-hero-copy">
            Explore destinations with an active E-Visa category. Find your country,
            review the available visa options and get a clearer picture of the next steps.
          </p>
          <div class="ev-hero-points">
            <span><b>✓</b> Country directory</span>
            <span><b>✓</b> Requirements access</span>
            <span><b>✓</b> Guided next steps</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ev-passport" aria-hidden="true">
          <small>VISAMASTER • TRAVEL DOCUMENT</small>
          <div class="ev-passport-mark">✈</div>
          <strong>E-VISA</strong>
          <div class="ev-passport-line"></div>
          <div class="ev-passport-line"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="ev-search-area">
      <div class="ev-container">
        <div class="ev-search-panel">
          <span class="ev-search-symbol" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span>
          <div class="ev-search-content">
            <label for="vmCountrySearch">SEARCH YOUR DESTINATION</label>
            <input
              type="search"
              id="vmCountrySearch"
              placeholder="Enter a country name (e.g. Singapore)..."
              autocomplete="off"
              aria-label="Search E-Visa countries"
            />
          </div>
          <span class="ev-search-hint">E-VISA DIRECTORY</span>
          <button type="button" id="vmClearCountrySearch" aria-label="Clear country search" hidden>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
            <span class="ev-clear-text">Clear</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="ev-directory" id="visa-directory">
      <div class="ev-container">
        <div class="ev-section-top">
          <div>
            <span class="ev-section-kicker">Your next destination</span>
            <h2>Where would you like to go?</h2>
            <p>Choose a country to view its E-Visa options and requirements.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ev-count">
            <strong id="vmCountryCount"><%= eVisaCountries.length %></strong>
            <span id="vmCountryCountLabel">countries found</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <% if (typeof loadError !== "undefined" && loadError) { %>
          <div class="ev-message" role="status">
            <strong>The E-Visa directory is temporarily unavailable.</strong>
            Please refresh the page or contact our team for assistance.
          </div>
        <% } else if (eVisaCountries.length === 0) { %>
          <div class="ev-message" role="status">
            <strong>No E-Visa destinations are currently listed.</strong>
            Please check again later or contact our team for assistance.
          </div>
        <% } else { %>
          <div class="ev-country-grid vm-country-grid" id="vmCountryGrid">
            <% eVisaCountries.forEach((country, index) => {
              const countryFlag = String(country.flag || "").trim();
              const countryFlagIsImage = isFlagImage(countryFlag);
              const countryFlagPath = flagPath(countryFlag);
            %>
              <article
                class="ev-country-card vm-visa-country-card"
                data-country-slug="<%= country.slug %>"
                data-country-name="<%= country.name %>"
              >
                <span class="ev-card-index"><%= String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0") %></span>
                <div class="ev-card-top">
                  <span class="ev-flag" aria-hidden="true">
                    <% if (countryFlagIsImage) { %>
                      <img
  src="<%= countryFlagPath %>"
  alt="<%= country.name %> flag"
  loading="lazy"
/>
                      <span class="ev-flag-fallback" hidden>🌍</span>
                    <% } else { %>
                      <span class="ev-flag-fallback"><%= countryFlag || "🌍" %></span>
                    <% } %>
                  </span>
                  <div class="ev-country-info">
                    <h3><%= country.name %></h3>
                    <span class="ev-available">E-Visa category listed</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <a
                  class="ev-card-link vm-country-requirements-link"
                  href="/countries/<%= country.slug %>/requirements/e-visa"
                >
                  <span style="color:inherit;font-size:11px;">Explore E-Visa requirements</span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                </a>
              </article>
            <% }) %>
          </div>

          <div class="ev-no-results vm-directory-no-results" id="vmVisaNoResults" hidden>
            <h3>No matching destination</h3>
            <p>Try another country name or contact our team for assistance.</p>
            <a class="ev-contact-link" href="/contact">Ask VisaMaster →</a>
          </div>
        <% } %>

        <p class="ev-disclaimer">
          <b>ⓘ Important:</b>
          E-Visa availability, eligibility, fees and application methods may vary by nationality
          and travel purpose. Confirm current rules before submitting an application.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ev-steps" aria-labelledby="evStepsTitle">
      <div class="ev-container">
        <div class="ev-steps-heading">
          <span class="ev-section-kicker">A simple route forward</span>
          <h2 id="evStepsTitle">Your E-Visa journey, made clearer.</h2>
          <p>Start with a destination, understand the visa options and review the information before proceeding.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ev-steps-grid">
          <article class="ev-step">
            <span class="ev-step-no">STEP 01</span>
            <span class="ev-step-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span>
            <h3>Find a country</h3>
            <p>Search the directory and choose the destination you plan to visit.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ev-step">
            <span class="ev-step-no">STEP 02</span>
            <span class="ev-step-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</span>
            <h3>Explore visa options</h3>
            <p>Review the active E-Visa purposes and information available for that country.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ev-step">
            <span class="ev-step-no">STEP 03</span>
            <span class="ev-step-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <h3>Check requirements</h3>
            <p>Read the eligibility and document details, or contact our team if you need help.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ev-note">
      <div class="ev-container">
        <div class="ev-note-inner">
          <span class="ev-note-icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span>
          <div class="ev-note-copy">
            <h3>Visa rules can change.</h3>
            <p>Eligibility, fees, processing times and required documents may differ by nationality and travel purpose. Always confirm the latest rules before applying.</p>
          </div>
          <a class="ev-note-link" href="/contact">Talk to our team →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include("../partials/footer") %>

 <script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
<script src="/js/e-visa.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
